## 🚀 About Me

**Cloud Architect & DevOps Engineer with 4+ years of hands-on experience** designing, automating, securing, and operating production cloud infrastructure.

I help build **reliable, scalable, secure, and automated platforms** across AWS & Azure, with a strong focus on SaaS, healthcare, containers, CI/CD, IaC, and DevSecOps.

```text
☁️ Cloud Architecture    → AWS / Azure / HA / Migration
🏗️ Infrastructure        → Terraform / IaC / Automation
🐳 Containers             → Docker / ECS / Kubernetes
🔄 CI/CD                 → GitHub Actions / Jenkins / AWS
🔐 DevSecOps             → Trivy / SonarQube / IAM / Secrets
📊 Observability         → Prometheus / Grafana / Alerting
```

